<title>THAILAND: Star, Univest shares resume trading Wednesday-SET.</title>
<headline>Star, Univest shares resume trading Wednesday-SET.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of construction firm Star Block Plc and developer Univest Land Plc can resume trading on Wednesday, the Stock Exchange of Thailand said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Shares of the cash-strapped firms have been suspended since early March.</p>
